## [1.0.0] — {{DATE}}

### Added

- Initial methodology based on AIDEX audit-conventions.
- Six shared principles (Finding ≠ Issue ≠ Task; `00-inventory.md` as SoT; living methodology; findings never deleted; escalation flow; shared concerns flagged).
- Status lifecycle: `open` → `doing` → `done` / `dropped` (see [`00-global.md` §6](../../../skills/aidex-conventions/references/00-global.md#6-status-vocabulary)).
- Severity levels: P0 / P1 / P2 / P3.

